JUnit XML
---------
Dogfood reads and writes the file format commonly called "JUnit XML". That format
was never specified by the JUnit project; the shape every runner emits descends
from the Apache Ant task org.apache.tools.ant.taskdefs.optional.junit
(Apache Ant, Apache License 2.0).

Dogfood contains no JUnit source code, links to no JUnit library, and bundles no
JUnit schema. It implements an independent reader and writer for a file format.
JUnit itself is a separate work: JUnit 4 is licensed under the Eclipse Public
License 1.0 and JUnit 5 under the Eclipse Public License 2.0. Neither licence
applies to this product.
